2026-11-07T05:26:43.0910720Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1643060Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1684820Z [0m
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1686330Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1687550Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1688770Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1689230Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1689820Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1690300Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1690650Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1691300Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1691640Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1692140Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1692960Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1693640Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1694250Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1694560Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1694830Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1695190Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1695490Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1695920Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1696280Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1696490Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1696830Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1698840Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1700080Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1735970Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1736560Z I will:
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1737240Z 
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1737710Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1738190Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1739080Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1739600Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1739870Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1740160Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1740600Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1741000Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1785730Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T05:26:43.1786300Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
